| TransE  | ‖h + r - t‖   | 0.294         | 0.226      | 简单高效   |
| RotatE  | ‖h ∘ r - t‖   | 0.338         | 0.476      | 旋转变换   |
| ConvE   | CNN(h, r) · t | 0.325         | 0.430      | 卷积交互   |
